Oct 13 20:41:53 linuc qemu-ga[437]: info: guest-shutdown called, mode: powerdown
Oct 13 20:41:53 linuc systemd-logind[443]: System is powering down (hypervisor initiated shutdown).
student@linuc:~$
logout

